  "title": "McKesson ideaShare 2026 Fuels Momentum for Independent Pharmacies",
  "summary": "McKesson ideaShare is a premier event for independent community pharmacy professionals, bringing together leaders from across the country for education, networking and collaboration focused on helping independent pharmacies innovate and thrive. McKesson ideaShare 2026 focused on the strategies, tools and connections independent community pharmacies need to navigate a changing healthcare landscape and create lasting value for patients and communities.",
